camera: allow T124 MIPI calibration on CSI E/F

OV5693 on mocha is wired to CSI E.  tegra_channel_mipi_cal() only
mapped ports A-D, so a csi-port=4 DT produced 'unknown port 4' and
the stream never calibrated or enabled the CIL.

--- a/drivers/media/platform/tegra/camera/channel.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/tegra/camera/channel.c
@@ -970,6 +970,12 @@
 	case PORT_D:
 		lanes = CSID;
 		break;
+	case PORT_E:
+		lanes = CSIE;
+		break;
+	case PORT_F:
+		lanes = CSIF;
+		break;
 	default:
 		dev_err(chan->vi->dev, "MIPI_CAL: unknown port %u\n",
 			chan->port[0]);
